WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,750
Is this what you call evidence?

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:05,910
This is at least proof that you have the motive to commit a crime.

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,870
We have investigated clearly

4
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,230
Yang Jun and others many years ago

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,990
Because your father was beaten during house demolition, when you came back

6
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:15,550
Your father, who came to seek revenge from him, is dead.

7
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:17,990
So you killed Yang Jun to take revenge, right?

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:20,620
Since I want to kill him

9
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,260
Why should I go to him first and let you know clearly?

10
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,180
This matter has something to do with me

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,580
Can't I just kill him?

12
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,980
Why should I bother

13
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,690
Since I want revenge

14
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,160
Yang Jun was not the only one who beat my father, why should I only kill him?

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,920
One does not kill others because

16
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,410
Are you the one interrogating me?

17
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,330
Or am I interrogating you?

18
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:40,250
Pay attention to your attitude Captain Li

19
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,420
You have to suspect me of murder

20
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:45,960
That's your freedom, but you want to arrest me

21
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,360
Please provide conclusive evidence

22
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,280
Next time you arrest me without any conclusive evidence.

23
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,040
Please don't let anyone arrest me again

24
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:53,880
This time I won't argue with you

25
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,720
But I don't want it to happen again

26
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:02,100
Anyway, no matter what

27
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:07,740
You are currently the biggest suspect, Captain Li. Can I leave? No, where do you think this is?

28
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:09,180
Do you come when you want and leave when you want?

29
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,780
I advise you not to play tricks on me

30
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,920
If you have conclusive evidence

31
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:22,090
Then you can catch me and lock me up now. If you don't, I'm sorry, I don't have the time.

32
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:29,940
I will continue to play here with you. When you find conclusive evidence, come and arrest me. Chen Yundong is right.

33
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:31,300
I have no conclusive evidence

34
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:32,220
Prove that you killed him

35
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,700
But we have reason to doubt you

36
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:36,100
Because you have a motive to kill

37
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,580
We have the right to bring you in for questioning

38
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,220
You must also explain clearly to us

39
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:42,140
you from last night

40
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:43,940
What have you done up to this morning?

41
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,700
It must be explained clearly

42
00:01:49,810 --> 00:01:52,500
Captain, if someone is looking for you, why don't you go?

43
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:53,660
If you have anything to come to me, please wait.

44
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:55,580
Captain, the Captain ordered

45
00:01:57,390 --> 00:02:04,390
Okay, I'll go over to Chen Yundong right away

46
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:08,150
You'd better be honest with me and I'll tell you that I will definitely find evidence.

47
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:10,270
No one has ever been able to bring you to justice

48
00:02:10,270 --> 00:02:16,610
I haven't settled the debt with you for running away from me twice.
